# Customer Support Ticket System

## 📌 Overview
This project is a Customer Support Ticket System built using:
- WinForms (Frontend)
- ASP.NET Core Web API (Backend)
- MySQL (Database)

## 🚀 Features
- User Login
- Create Ticket
- View Tickets (role-based)
- Admin can assign tickets
- Update ticket status
- Add comments
- Ticket history tracking

## 🛠️ Tech Stack
- .NET 8
- WinForms
- ASP.NET Web API
- MySQL

## ⚙️ Setup Instructions

1. Clone the repository
2. Run the SQL script (Database/script.sql)
3. Update connection string in appsettings.json
4. Run API project
5. Run Desktop project



## 📌 Notes
- Desktop communicates only via API
- Role-based access implemented
